WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
Hello, everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome back to job simulator.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.300
BACON! whoo shit. Eh, it's probably still good

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:10.360
Is this hot? Oh shit... It's so realistic. It's bubbling.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.060
I wonder what will happen if I - *munch* Whoa.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:13.180
I didn't mean to do that!

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.920
I love it when my eggs are on fire. They call it "Eggs Benedick"

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:21.020
Job Bot: Now put your creations on the plate,
and you can ring the bell to send it out to the restaurant.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.880
Mark: Oh, that would be much better than just setting it on the dirty counter top!

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.880
Job Bot: "Tea", the traditional human beverage -

00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:31.520
Crumpets. Crumpets, crumpets, crumpets. Are these crumpets?
I don't know what British speak means!

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:33.120
*Mark gets drunk*

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:36.460
Corn, cookie, and pretzel soup. Naturally artificial.

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.700
Is it a never-ending loaf of bread?

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.280
Oooh my God it iiiiiis

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:45.200
Oh my God! It never ennnnnds!

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:50.300
French Bot: It is a 1984 vintage. Eh? I wish to have it prepared.

00:00:50.309 --> 00:00:50.829
Mark: Ew!

00:00:50.829 --> 00:00:55.140
It looks delicious! What happens if I put olive oil in a cup? Would you like that?

00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:56.820
I mean you're French,
you wouldn't know the difference, huh?

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:59.100
*INTENSE MUSIC*

00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.680
Waiter Bot: We got three bots out here to ordered the special...

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.860
Mark: I'm going to be exactly uncreative.

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:06.720
Sriracha on a potato...

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.340
How about corn Cob Sandwich? And a little garnish?

00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:11.080
How about an irradiated cactus?

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.100
PewDiePie: The hell man?!

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:14.680
Mark: All right, you're welcome there buddy. Hope you're having a good day!

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:30.880
*elevator music*

